/*
0 - @include - use your previously-defined mixins right at the start for ease of modification and readability.
1 - Structure - display, position, margin, padding, width, height, box-sizing, overflow etc.
2 - Typography - font-*, line-height, text-*, letter-spacing etc.
3 - Cosmetic - color, background-*, border-*, animation, transition etc.
4 - Native interaction - appearance, cursor, user-select, pointer-events etc.
5 - Pseudo-elements - ::before, ::after etc.
6 - Nested elements
7 - Pseudo-classes - :hover, :focus, :active etc.
8 - @media - media queries should be defined last for ease of modification and readability.
